---
---
<section id="contact" class="py-32 md:py-48 border-t border-line">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-3">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-tight text-ink-3">{"// 05 — contact"}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-9">
        <h2 class="text-display text-[40px] md:text-[64px] lg:text-[88px] text-ink max-w-4xl">
          $ ./let_us_talk
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-[12px] text-ink-3">$ open mailto:contact@encrews.co.jp</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border border-line rounded-sm p-8 md:p-12 font-mono">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-8">
        <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6">
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-ink-3 mb-4">→ For Business</p>
          <a href="mailto:contact@encrews.co.jp" class="block text-[20px] md:text-[26px] text-ink border-b border-ink/20 pb-3 hover:border-ink transition-colors">
            contact@encrews.co.jp
          </a>
          <p class="mt-4 text-[12px] text-ink-2 font-sans font-light leading-[1.9]">
            新規事業の構想、店舗の立ち上げ、組織の刷新。<br/>
            まずはお話を聞かせてください。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6">
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-ink-3 mb-4">→ For Career</p>
          <a href="#" class="block text-[20px] md:text-[26px] text-ink border-b border-ink/20 pb-3 hover:border-ink transition-colors">
            ./join --crew
          </a>
          <p class="mt-4 text-[12px] text-ink-2 font-sans font-light leading-[1.9]">
            一緒に事業を立ち上げる仲間を募集中。<br/>
            職種・経験は問いません。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-3">
      <span class="text-emerald-700">●</span> Server is online. Awaiting your request.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
